            <div xml:id="d257">

                <pb facs="0298" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 20437/114.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-08-16"><hi rendition="#italic">August 16,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Department intends to send early in September one of its commercial advisers
                    to cooperate with you regarding the potash question, the settlement of which
                    apparently demands further diplomatic action.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
